[{"id":"x:22644749933","platform":"x","post_id":"22644749933","published_at":"2010-08-31T20:00:03.000Z","text":"Went to the Yankees game last night with Bill O'Reilly--we had a great time watching the Yankees win!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/22644749933","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:22551244200","platform":"x","post_id":"22551244200","published_at":"2010-08-30T19:50:43.000Z","text":"Spent a beautiful weekend golfing at Trump National Golf Club Westchester and Trump National Golf Club Bedminster.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/22551244200","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:22207798183","platform":"x","post_id":"22207798183","published_at":"2010-08-26T20:42:57.000Z","text":"The Miss Universe Pageant raked in some great ratings! A great job by everyone.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/22207798183","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:22003109005","platform":"x","post_id":"22003109005","published_at":"2010-08-24T14:07:12.000Z","text":"Congratulations to Miss Mexico, Jimena Navarrete, our new Miss Universe 2010, and congratulations to everyone for a fantastic show.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/22003109005","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:21915730688","platform":"x","post_id":"21915730688","published_at":"2010-08-23T13:55:10.000Z","text":"It's going to get hotter in Las Vegas tonight! Watch the Miss Universe Pageant tonight on NBC at 9 p.m. I'm looking forward to being there!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/21915730688","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:21601308367","platform":"x","post_id":"21601308367","published_at":"2010-08-19T19:15:36.000Z","text":"Four more days until the Miss Universe Pageant. Be sure to tune in on Monday night at 9 p.m. on NBC--it will be an amazing show.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/21601308367","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:21598934653","platform":"x","post_id":"21598934653","published_at":"2010-08-19T18:35:42.000Z","text":"The original Apprentice returns with a two hour premiere on Thursday September 16th. Looking forward to a fantastic season!","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/21598934653","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:21004697973","platform":"x","post_id":"21004697973","published_at":"2010-08-12T20:55:12.000Z","text":"So don't forget to enter the Serta Counting Sheep for Hire contest! www.youtube.com/user/mattressserta","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/21004697973","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:21004551484","platform":"x","post_id":"21004551484","published_at":"2010-08-12T20:52:45.000Z","text":"That trip would be to the Trump International Hotel Las Vegas... http://www.trump.com/Hotel_Collection/Trump_Las_Vegas/Trump_Las_Vegas.asp","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/21004551484","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{