mber 14 https://www.erictrumpfoundation.com/?nd=ticket_list&fundraiser_id=8","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/20979570755","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:20708393094","platform":"x","post_id":"20708393094","published_at":"2010-08-09T13:38:04.000Z","text":"Mark your calenders for August 23rd: http://www.missuniverse.com/","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/20708393094","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:20307691790","platform":"x","post_id":"20307691790","published_at":"2010-08-04T14:19:20.000Z","text":"Performing live on the Miss Universe Pageant from the Mandalay Bay Resort & Casino will be Telemundo, Orianthi, John Legend and The Roots.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/20307691790","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:20307423177","platform":"x","post_id":"20307423177","published_at":"2010-08-04T14:15:22.000Z","text":"The Miss Universe Pageant will be on August 23 (9-11 p.m. on NBC, ET) with Bret Michaels and Natalie Morales to co-host, live from Las Vegas","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/20307423177","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"}]